### 获取所有 album
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums

### 创建一个新 album
POST http://localhost:8080/api/albums
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "In Rainbows",
  "artist": "Radiohead",
  "releaseYear": 2007,
  "genre": "Experimental Rock"
}

### 根据 id 查询（先跑完上面的 POST，看返回的 id 是多少，改成对应的数字）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums/2

### 更新 album
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/albums/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "In Rainbows (Deluxe)",
  "artist": "Radiohead",
  "releaseYear": 2007,
  "genre": "Experimental Rock"
}

### 删除 album
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/albums/2

### 确认删除成功（应该返回 404，或者列表里没有了）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums/2